{"id": "EUVD-2026-94411", "enisaUuid": "2cbeff27-feba-3a75-8984-00906e3eccb9", "description": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to 7.1.2-30 and 6.9.13-55, a crafted highly compressed MAT image can make the MAT decoder create temporary files larger than the configured security-policy limit, bypassing resource restrictions and consuming excessive disk space. This issue is fixed in versions 7.1.2-30 and 6.9.13-55.", "datePublished": "2026-10-07T15:59:42", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-10T02:35:14", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:L", "references": ["https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-3j4w-pvxj-fpjc", "https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/ae2ed8c81d8fad1f186e7f2bc0837b46a1c7be61", "https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/7d8e0eb11804a5ce5322ea317dfd3557cded4e7b", "https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/releases/tag/7.1.2-30", "https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/releases/tag/6.9.13-55"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-107210"], "assigner": "GitHub_M", "epss": 0.34, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "557ea570-f618-3b25-b2a7-71aa9e766eca", "product": {"name": "ImageMagick", "vendor": {"name": "ImageMagick"}}, "product_version": "7.0.0, < 7.1.2-30"}, {"id": "fa5f052d-e128-3950-8e41-4d0396aed7aa", "product": {"name": "ImageMagick", "vendor": {"name": "ImageMagick"}}, "product_version": "< 6.9.13-55"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "7f0fa7d7-7864-3953-8d45-551073a23835", "vendor": {"name": "ImageMagick"}}], "isExploited": false}